    "storage and raw persistent mutations refused under the fence",
    "native dispatch and Lua handback cannot bypass the cluster fence",
    "crashed fenced leader restarts without writable application initialization",
    "killed copy controller leaves incomplete files and durable source fences",
    "complete cluster manifest binds all physical replicas to the same cut",
    "explicit source release and restart restore service after the frozen cut",
    "killed restore controller leaves whole-cluster and per-node startup fences",
    "corrupted physical copy cannot produce a verified cluster restore",
    "physical restore stays quarantined until whole-cluster validation",
    "quarantined startup has no replication, writable service or application initialization",
    "every user row, schema and persisted protocol space matches the cut",
    "interrupted activation refuses startup when a child marker is already removed",
    "post-cut source acknowledgement is outside the documented RPO",
    "isolated restored RF3 cluster serves exact acknowledged data and new writes",
    "late retained lazy frame cannot resurrect membership after GC, move and restore"
